{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06526","headline":"述降圣观 · 储光羲","name":"述降圣观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一山尽天苑，一峰开道宫。\n道花飞羽衞，天鸟游云空。\n玉殿俯玄水，春旗摇素风。\n夹门小松柏，覆井新梧桐。\n自昔大仙下，乃知元化功。\n神皇作桂馆，此意与天通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06526.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06526","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}